  abstract     = {This post is aimed to be an accessible introduction to the idea of AI Institutions. This concept is the root that enables the large-scale human cooperation. Understanding its core dynamics can be seen as a necessary step to build AI institutions. The analogy is: humans studied birds to understand the physics of flight to build the plane. We here study the dynamics of human intelligent dynamic cooperation to build the AI institutions.}
